The following rules were ported from riverpod_lint, and their detection logic
follows that implementation:

  - async_value_nullable_pattern (and its quick fix)
  - avoid_build_context_in_providers
  - missing_provider_scope (and its quick fix)
  - notifier_build (and its quick fix)
  - protected_notifier_properties
  - provider_parameters

